warning[redundant_cast]: `x` is already `s32`
  --> tests/lint/redundant_cast/example.jai:5:10
   |
 5 |     y := cast(s32) x;
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: remove the cast
   |
 5 ~     y := x;
   |
   = note: `redundant_cast` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/redundant_cast/
